{
  "slug": "mantine",
  "name": "Mantine",
  "framework": "react",
  "version": "9.5.2",
  "repo": "mantinedev/mantine",
  "license": {
    "github": "MIT",
    "npm": "MIT"
  },
  "theme": {
    "dark": true,
    "nativeIcons": false
  },
  "routes": [
    "/login",
    "/",
    "/orders",
    "/form",
    "/settings",
    "/components",
    "/landing",
    "/chat"
  ],
  "externals": {
    "chart": "@mantine/charts",
    "markdown": "react-markdown + remark-gfm"
  },
  "notes": "Mantine 9.5.2 默认主题（primaryColor blue，未自定义配色），color scheme 由 ?theme= 驱动 MantineProvider forceColorScheme。Mantine 无自带图标库（官方文档推荐 @tabler/icons-react），故 nativeIcons=false，所有图标经 @ui-gallery/icons-react 适配层，支持 ?icon=lucide|tabler|phosphor|heroicons。字体使用仓库自托管的 Inter/Geist/Noto Sans SC/LXGW WenKai（?font=）。图表用官方 @mantine/charts（基于 recharts）。Transfer/Mention/QRCode/Watermark/Tour 为 Mantine 未提供的组件，标记 missing；Statistic/Result/Popconfirm/BackTop/FloatButton/DataGrid 由原生组件组合实现，标记 composed。",
